# Wave T43 (Coalseam kit): coalcarts — a timber mine cart banded in iron, heaped with black coal (pale glints on the facets), standing on a short rail stub with sleepers. It stands at the foot of the Coalseam Mine sign ('Mind the carts; they do not mind you') — the singing cart line of MINER BRAM's tale, carried as dressing beside the backend's own miningcart cells. Fully opaque — the town grass is baked in (measured #1c7c0c from the shipped render). (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T43-COALSEAM-PLAN.md §5.)
